# Raw fetched payloads are a rebuildable CACHE, not source. 24MB / ~1,570 files
# of upstream JSON+xlsx. `python data/refresh_data.py` regenerates them from
# public, keyless sources and is idempotent. What the app actually reads is
# data/processed_data/, which IS committed so a bare clone runs with no network.
